<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia July forex reserves rise to $3.76 billion.</title>
<headline>Slovenia July forex reserves rise to $3.76 billion.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Slovenia reported the following economic indicator details on Monday.</p>
<p>SLOVENIA FOREIGN EXCHANGE RESERVES</p>
<p>    (million dollars)		    July	  June	  July95</p>
<p>    Total reserves		 3,759.1     3,558.9	3,317.3</p>
<p>    Bank of Slovenia reserves  1,749.3     1,639.8	1,707.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Total reserves are reserves held by the whole banking system. -- Novica Mihajlovic, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
